          "items": [
            "Beautiful 4 bed / 4.5 bath. Located immediately across from the Rosemary beach tennis courts and a short walk of 350 yards to the beach. House is finished with high end furniture, appliances, and accessories. 2 king, 1 queen, 2 single, and 2 large comfortable couches for additional sleeping room, sleeps 10. <br><br>**Please note that this property does not come with access to the Rosemary Beach pools or amenities****<br><br><br>Street legal golf cart is available for a fee (120/day or 700/week)<br><br>Please make sure to report the correct number of the guests. <br>There is a 150$ fee per night for any unreported guest.<br><br>Also available for rental is a 1br/1br carriage house for an additional $215/night if rented simultaneously with the main house when available dates overlap (VRBO Listing #481175).<br>",
